### GET semua data - 200
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### GET data ID 1 - 200
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### GET ID tidak ditemukan - 404
GET http://localhost:3000/products/999

### POST data baru - 201
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Penghapus",
  "price": 3000
}

### POST validasi gagal - 400
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -1
}

### PUT ubah ID 1 - 200
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buku Tulis",
  "price": 18000
}

### DELETE produk ID 2 - 200
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2

### GET data setelah PUT dan DELETE - 200
GET http://localhost:3000/products
